{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2303f36bcd52a26cdb838625cfb43809e52f1b99df55b9a52e51db778b1e9467", "ja": "（次の定期公演、センターは真美だ。\n本人の希望で、ラブソングを歌う事になっている）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演，C位是真美。按她本人的意愿，这次要唱情歌。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3770c3a8a6f17850fd82665da7731c7899a35f3b6fbf7c90c4be02717334b02d", "ja": "（ただ、ステージの演出に関して、\n考え方というか、方向性の違いが生じていて……）", "zh": "（不过，关于舞台演出，双方产生了想法，或者说方向上的分歧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1002_null", "source_sha256": "3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0", "ja": "数日前……", "zh": "几天前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "601c35a4ddb7c41b5ca3d2fec6602bc8ac34ecb3173fc7f4e3d752872884cb85", "ja": "でね！　セクシーなダンスを踊ってるとこに、\n真美がポップアップでドッカーン！て登場するの！", "zh": "然后呀！正在跳性感舞蹈的时候，真美要从升降台上“砰！”地登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3739b4c6fc7e6893b5a8d5a89936530d8e588a54ec16bcdc689055d077280020", "ja": "却下だ。", "zh": "驳回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "f977370f9a6e4f4d5f5754d5ac5cf88826b0e571859b7921384abc39c1b8050f", "ja": "なんで！？", "zh": "为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8aebdc6b2c587090bf3814459f3aac22bca70c51b7dccc6918b76240831efd2e", "ja": "なんでって、ダメに決まってるだろ……。\n曲の印象とも全然合ってないし。", "zh": "都说了为什么，当然不行啊……\n和歌曲给人的印象也完全不搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f00a0324a135eef7271058d02d4c214fadead6bf0a8f5ce28bd6680fe4efb0a0", "ja": "それに、真美は中学生なんだから。\n年相応の演出をした方が、ステージ映えするよ。", "zh": "而且，真美还是初中生。\n采用符合她年龄的演出，舞台效果会更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f093dc934b6b6f3ea344e5e72d5134b3a7d5082cd8245779a9f077f83d8cd44", "ja": "うあうあ～！　兄ちゃんが真美にイジワルする～～！\nこんなんじゃ真美、亜美に負けちゃうよ～～！", "zh": "哇啊哇啊～！大哥欺负真美～～！\n这样下去真美就要输给亚美了啦～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6b9f1ef85aa102bb47c93eacde207bd261dd835133340af417c01860f5288bac", "ja": "亜美と張り合ってるのか？　だったら、尚更ダメだ。\nステージは、お客さんに見てもらうものなんだからな。", "zh": "你是在和亚美较劲吗？那就更不行了。\n舞台可是要让观众看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "2e9b9351da43019257748ec22dbc8438f35b1f30a249471c2f4a7b7501d8a174", "ja": "うあうあ、全否定だよ～！\n兄ちゃんってば、さっきからセイロンティーばっかり！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊，完全否定了啦～！\n哥哥从刚才开始就净说些正确的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1011_p", "source_sha256": "40d8b7c54b800e73a349adb43eab91741161bf4683d4e117a1a71007c7814e20", "ja": "正論だってわかってるんじゃないか……。", "zh": "你不是也明白这是正论吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "26cd801a9177336beccc06b243146d3e044f4569559ef3f1556a5b923fbe38d0", "ja": "兄ちゃんはちっともわかってないよ！\n双子には、戦わなくちゃいけない時があることを……。", "zh": "哥哥你根本就不明白嘛！\n双胞胎也有不得不战斗的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "e52795e7ba053988689e3dbabb9210016cacaec0600f4df43466e6ebafaf915e", "ja": "真美のステージは、亜美よりオトナでなきゃダメなの！\n絶対絶対、兄ちゃんにセクシーを認めさせるかんね！", "zh": "真美的舞台，必须比亚美的更成熟才行！\n绝对绝对要让哥哥承认真美的性感不可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1014_p", "source_sha256": "64e551f9b00223cc38fbe42bf20a66c34ccfd548a3637524e06db0935609851a", "ja": "いや別に、セクシーだけが大人という訳じゃ……。\nあっ、こら！　どこに行くんだ、真美～！", "zh": "倒也不是说，只有性感才算成熟……\n啊，喂！你要去哪儿啊，真美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "88766bff1263ed97ffc8d2cf5a227babb635ec3ed773c9cfb4953fe5d9118e58", "ja": "以上！　回想シーンおしまい！", "zh": "以上！回忆场景结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "300b418da23f9684ad62832256791a2a428753b38de95121bffe7a5c6732587b", "ja": "なるほど……つまり舞台の演出について、\n{$P$}と意見がわかれたと。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，在舞台演出方面，和{$P$}的意见产生了分歧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "f9ff2a96d7ec16ca405a08867bbaa20afe90b94927768db054e14fbd81c3c703", "ja": "だいたい兄ちゃんはアタマが鉱石すぎるんだよね～。\n宝石なら、真美がもらったげてもいーけど？", "zh": "哥哥你的脑袋也太像矿石了吧～  \n要是宝石的话，真美倒是可以勉为其难收下哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "8b9710775860e9f303a3f976f604c21f63875131b787ac9b38c6f37cc668e928", "ja": "亜美がしっとり系で攻めるなら、\n真美はセクシーでオトナをアピるっきゃないっしょ！？", "zh": "要是亚美走抒情路线，真美就只能用性感来展现成熟魅力了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "67dac9eea69c09d5c5a7da47966efe4b2e8d7431d1b78e9a083578d2b7f9e1c3", "ja": "ラブソングに相応しい、セクシーで大人なステージ。\n……なるほど、やぶさかではないぞ。", "zh": "适合情歌的性感成熟舞台。\n……原来如此，我并不反对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "03836fff2a2baf5196b41e3d2ade3a6646c266cead9a8cb10b1225e7f746f585", "ja": "？　エミリー、『やぶさか』って何？", "zh": "？艾米莉，“不吝惜”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4554a267fc294376138a98bc780caa0d0ef5351ed711fc7f43cab1f098a71d4", "ja": "『やぶさか』というのは、惜しむという意味です。\nなのでこの場合は、惜しまない、という意味ですね。", "zh": "“吝啬”的意思，就是舍不得。\n所以在这里，意思就是“不吝啬”、“毫不犹豫”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e37f2896ca6486abf987815fd8b781bf0ac2d8de22df57ec34a1eabd75b83f57", "ja": "ええ。そして真壁さんの言う『惜しまない』とは、\nこの場合「公演をがんばる」ということかと。", "zh": "嗯。而真壁所说的“不吝惜”，在这里应该是指“努力完成演出”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "a36bcfe2b22eab906c7a9ded8bf04bfe5fa309d5c504f43b534a95d060e0aef0", "ja": "そっか！　なら、たまきもおしまない！\nまみの公演、がんばるぞ～。くふふ！", "zh": "这样啊！那环也不会吝惜！\n为了真美的公演，加油咯～嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "ca7cdd68af6ee8b9187481868f1a220a5713b88a87a462207e3ecab60b503267", "ja": "みずきん、たまきち……！\nみんなやる気で、真美はうれしいよ！", "zh": "瑞希、小环……！\n大家这么有干劲，真美太高兴啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6ee98d053557d315fd514d627345914e2bd1d36c8022cc0b96374f605a41ee1", "ja": "こうなったら、なんとしてでも真美のセクシーを\n兄ちゃんに認めさせて、ギャフンと言わせてやる～！", "zh": "既然这样，不管怎样都要让哥哥认可真美的性感，让他哑口无言～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "7ed2b6a47fc06fc415a1cbdffc1e5c2ca4cb9021f59cd909e4b2b9913380d506", "ja": "{$P$}が真美さんのセクシーを\n否定できないよう、外堀を埋めていく作戦ですね。", "zh": "这是为了让{$P$}无法否定真美小姐的性感，而逐步填平外围护城河的作战策略呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "28baa64310fbc661e4467d207420ed27989ffb5cd5301b93c120d63332d7db55", "ja": "難攻不落の城攻めには、必須ですね！\nしかし仕掛け人さまの外堀とは、一体……？", "zh": "攻打难攻不落的城池，这是必不可少的呢！\n不过，制作人先生的外围防线究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "c8fe5349bf29bc0c25a093e22dac2d85ecefe5d7be583d7302942d9236dd9592", "ja": "それは、わかんないけど！", "zh": "这个嘛，我也不知道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1029_null", "source_sha256": "3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6", "ja": "レッスン後……", "zh": "练习后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "be313382c4038270758f0a97c3ada4a66361462aee3d9629187f768f7515e0f2", "ja": "兄ちゃんめ……ブツブツ。\nどうやってわからせてくれようか……。", "zh": "哥哥真是的……嘀嘀咕咕。\n要怎么让他明白才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1031_kano", "source_sha256": "e44059ec43a5719347a88cdb474bb968072d404ebacee608b139ea908b9009a7", "ja": "あの、すみません！\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "那个，不好意思！\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "fefcf767bccae4056fffad1219217628538faeff347700b449e00441b6a563b7", "ja": "ん？　……真美のこと？", "zh": "嗯？……找真美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1033_kano", "source_sha256": "08ea53d57e8ece12814b7cfcc667ced0afa6e1ce6f97ac188c52e3ce2129af8f", "ja": "そう、あなたです！\n……うん！　やっぱり、イメージにピッタリ！", "zh": "没错，就是你！\n……嗯！果然和想象中一模一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1f344e34109e7ca1ecab8ff977809d16d07ddae54d3a1f08c081173abefd3101", "ja": "あの……？　失礼ですが、\n真美さんにどのような用件で？", "zh": "请问……？冒昧问一下，\n您找真美是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1035_kano", "source_sha256": "b39b0789628311f483e8e619055d496beaa710a19c11bf03254b4646866f97c9", "ja": "あ、すみません！\n私、写真を撮っていて……こういう者です。", "zh": "啊，不好意思！\n我刚才在拍照……我是这种人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "9ca600e2c36f6dce088fde1dc00da98490e42bb9c65f66c516fa2f442864d0bd", "ja": "写真作家・フォトグラファー　假野（KARINO）\n……カメラマンさん、でしょうか。", "zh": "摄影作家·摄影师　假野（KARINO）\n……是摄影师吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1037_kano", "source_sha256": "30987d032d9c91867db5ef20590e04e8f774cf2022b617e807d978fa8f3eca87", "ja": "そうです！　主に人物写真を撮っています。", "zh": "没错！主要拍摄人物照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "7b0b1d6eee02e86a72fece6a178630d2d13907267b261d6ca76fa8b80cde1666", "ja": "カメラマンのお姉さん。\nもしかして、まみの写真撮りたいの？", "zh": "摄影师姐姐。\n难道是想拍真美的照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1039_kano", "source_sha256": "a7514fcef7428f29adffb6ce0c574d5fb6e9b8b19734ae059b4b4fb4f2219acc", "ja": "ええ！　真美さんが、私が撮りたいと思っていた\n女の子のイメージにぴったりなんです！", "zh": "没错！真美小姐正好符合我一直想拍摄的女孩子形象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1040_kano", "source_sha256": "d6004db0a0c1d85041b9fa78e61a816cf3c452d5a44254adb970b269dbc6f949", "ja": "是非、モデルとして出演をお願いできませんか？\n謝礼ももちろんさせていただきます。", "zh": "能否请您作为模特出演？\n当然也会支付相应的报酬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1041_012mam", "source_sha256": "89ddb42b33fa33718a9b7f0aeda02e1f543e276155531beda3954fc217bbe5b8", "ja": "モデル……真美が！？", "zh": "模特……真美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1042_kano", "source_sha256": "9bec06a5a94a3c0067ac4982b5668027aefb8deefc17047d82d8ecea3a84c21a", "ja": "あっ、もちろん\nご両親の許可が頂けたらになりますけど。", "zh": "啊，当然了——不过还是要得到您父母的许可才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1043_kano", "source_sha256": "019f0c65eaa19b67738592c376d063dca5bdd6e83e502cd5da9a01f96da69d20", "ja": "怪しいと思ったら、遠慮なく調べてくださいね！\nネットで検索してもらえれば、色々出てきますので。", "zh": "要是觉得可疑，请尽管去查查哦！\n在网上搜一下的话，就能查出很多东西的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "12fa278e80f2169bf1bd7ba65f35fc912c4b9fa2b452d742303d5a78833ff685", "ja": "え～っと……真美、ちょ～っと考えたいから。\n家で相談してきてもいい？", "zh": "呃……真美想稍微考虑一下。\n可以回家商量后再来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1045_kano", "source_sha256": "e2b6f756d711dfbec34a1a4393e6bf7ec6e7bc37268a75c6cb81af2e506fb89e", "ja": "もちろんです！　必要でしたら、\nご自宅に説明に伺っても構いません。", "zh": "当然可以！如果有需要的话，\n我登门为您说明也是完全没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1046_kano", "source_sha256": "fd3499bfe4701f1a16647661549a75cd6b0c29e514efa0f9de2ef26a8ec38af0", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！\nそれじゃ！", "zh": "请多关照！\n回头见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "c23b288a3a919d5ed55f5c023461878c694c985fcf9dff334d0ca4fd09890647", "ja": "……お仕事の依頼……ですよね。\n今の……。", "zh": "……是工作委托……对吧。\n刚才那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "22722e76746ba3b169bcdcc5a7afc37bf60788bfba50bfafe7385f15b4dd77b6", "ja": "お～！　知らない人にお仕事頼まれるなんて、\nまみすごいぞ～！", "zh": "哦～！居然有不认识的人来找我工作，真厉害啊，真美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1049_040tam", "source_sha256": "634be9f54d048c0bc6dbdd4e96be50804b98a944fa52045d17bbaa077bd07362", "ja": "あれ？　でもお仕事って、\n勝手に受けてもいいの？", "zh": "咦？不过，工作这种事，擅自接下来也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1050_044miz", "source_sha256": "258c0a6decab852e405926d95edceb8b45a26fdc6350f7f914ff353d035f0d06", "ja": "私達は、765プロのアイドルですから。\nお仕事を受けるには、事務所を通す必要があります。", "zh": "我们是765事务所的偶像。要接工作，就必须通过事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1051_040tam", "source_sha256": "0ff33a86b06adf6f62847b6559e14fc2390682ca2bf1f358358c0b8e93fea70e", "ja": "そうなんだ！\nじゃあ、すぐにおやぶんに言わなくちゃだね！", "zh": "这样啊！\n那就得赶紧告诉老大才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1052_012mam", "source_sha256": "04141a5411e7f1d4a5eabe9db468b4075f115454265d3cce8b4c88da6969a345", "ja": "これだよ……！\nこの手があった！", "zh": "就是这个……！\n原来还有这一招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "f6266bd4a9aac82c405caa92c90cfe7313501ce70a700faab2d2f2a5cedff5a9", "ja": "真美さん？", "zh": "真美姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1054_012mam", "source_sha256": "41998a450c75b7eeb1451aa9df060a39bd01fe81227688fd1c2072e513888b7d", "ja": "みんな、お願い！　このこと、兄ちゃんには\nちょっとの間だけナイショにしてくれる？", "zh": "大家，拜托了！这件事，能不能先对哥\n保密一阵子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1055_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3aa0880c398109999a69d317a9287cc1a38a186ac400d104374723f2fb3afaf7", "ja": "えっ……けど、真美さん。", "zh": "诶……可是，真美姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_164_1056_012mam", "source_sha256": "bf217f908b989211f1a44b8d53cacf07e75dff26e5a78013db4f0ef6034a056a", "ja": "大丈夫！　兄ちゃんには、真美から話すから。\nただその前に、ちょっとね。んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "没事的！真美会去跟老哥说的。\n不过在那之前，还有点事呢。哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
